    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d76">

                <pb facs="0782" n="632" xml:id="pg632"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3691/498.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Nicaragua
                        to President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua, Nicaragua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Peace signed day before yesterday, Amapala. I thank Your Excellency for your
                    great work toward achieving that happy result.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. S. Zelaya.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
